DLIST.ITEM.DEFINITION:
annualised greenhouse gas emissions from carbon stock change due to land-use change (measured as mass of CO2-equivalent per unit biomass fuel energy). Cropland
Cropland as defined by IPCC. and perennial cropland
Perennial crops are defined as multi-annual crops, the stem of which is usually not annually harvested such as short rotation coppice and oil palm. shall be regarded as one land use;
